licly accessible."}, {"source_id": "pe-2.3_gdn", "span_text": "Individuals without required security clearances, access approvals, or need to know are escorted by individuals with appropriate physical access authorizations to ensure that information is not exposed or otherwise compromised."}], "framework_version": "rev5", "odp_required_list": ["pe-02.03_odp.01", "pe-02_odp"], "primary_citation": "pe-2_smt", "question": "What are the requirements for managing facility access authorizations, credentials, and access lists for individuals entering secured areas?", "selected_source_ids": ["pe-2_smt", "pe-2_smt.b", "pe-2_smt.a", "pe-2_smt.d", "pe-2_smt.c", "pe-2.3_smt", "pe-2_gdn", "pe-2.3_gdn"], "status": "PARAMS_REQUIRED"}

